==Description==
'''GLHF''' is a sticker obtained from Private III rank of the [[PVP Season 0]].

==Appearance==
This sticker showcases two team opponents teaming up each other, with the text "''GLHF''" around it. It plays a short sound when used.

==Trivia==
*GLHF is a slang for "''Good luck, have fun''".

